# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2530
translate spanish mas_island_night1_2682391c:

    # m "While it's nice to be productive during the day, there's something so peaceful about the night."
    m "Aunque sienta bien ser productiva durante el día, la noche transmite muchísima paz."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2531
translate spanish mas_island_night1_abb37dd9:

    # m "The sounds of crickets chirping mixed with a gentle breeze is so relaxing."
    m "El sonido de los grillos cantando mezclado con una brisa suave es muy relajante."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2532
translate spanish mas_island_night1_d8f223d0:

    # m "You'd hold me on a night like that, right~"
    m "Me abrazarías en una noche así, ¿verdad?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2537
translate spanish mas_island_night2_ade2b592:

    # m "Too bad we can't see the stars tonight..."
    m "Es una pena que no podamos ver las estrellas esta noche..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2538
translate spanish mas_island_night2_a67ff96f:

    # m "I would've loved to gaze at the cosmos with you."
    m "Me habría encantado contemplar el cosmos contigo."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2539
translate spanish mas_island_night2_299379a2:

    # m "That's alright though, we'll get to see it some other time, then."
    m "Pero no pasa nada, ya lo veremos en otro momento."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2543
translate spanish mas_island_night2_e54131d9:

    # m "Aren't the stars so beautiful, [player]?"
    m "¿No son preciosas las estrellas, [player]?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2544
translate spanish mas_island_night2_37f2a01c:

    # m "Although, this isn't {i}quite{/i} what I had in mind when I mentioned stargazing before..."
    m "Aunque, a decir verdad, esto no es del todo lo que tenía en mente cuando hablé de mirar las estrellas..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2545
translate spanish mas_island_night2_4fdcb7e8:

    # m "As nice as they are to look at, the part that I want to experience most is being with you, holding each other tight while we lay there."
    m "Por muy bonitas que sean, lo que más me apetece es estar contigo, abrazad[end_letter_gender]s fuertemente mientras estamos ahí tumbad[end_letter_gender]s."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2546
translate spanish mas_island_night2_242155b9:

    # m "Someday, [player].{w=0.3} Someday."
    m "Algún día, [player].{w=0.3} Algún día."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2549
translate spanish mas_island_night2_35230d20:

    # m "Have you ever gone stargazing, [mas_get_player_nickname()]?"
    m "¿Alguna vez te has puesto a mirar las estrellas, [mas_get_player_nickname()]?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2550
translate spanish mas_island_night2_2472b865:

    # m "Taking some time out of your evening to look at the night sky and to just stare at the beauty of the sky above..."
    m "Dedicar un rato de tu noche a mirar el cielo y simplemente contemplar la belleza del firmamento..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2551
translate spanish mas_island_night2_c4d6c148:

    # m "It's surprisingly relaxing, you know?"
    m "Es sorprendentemente relajante, ¿sabes?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2552
translate spanish mas_island_night2_c8f52fa0:

    # m "I've found that it can really relieve stress and clear your head..."
    m "He descubierto que realmente puede aliviar el estrés y despejarte la mente..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2553
translate spanish mas_island_night2_901d5eed:

    # m "And seeing all kinds of constellations in the sky just fills your mind with wonder."
    m "Y ver todo tipo de constelaciones en el cielo te llena la mente de asombro."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2554
translate spanish mas_island_night2_64d26fcd:

    # m "Of course, it really makes you realize just how small we are in the universe."
    m "Por supuesto, realmente te hace darte cuenta de lo pequeños que somos en el universo."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2555
translate spanish mas_island_night2_f6daf90a:

    # m "Ahaha..."
    m "Ja, ja, ja."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2561
translate spanish mas_island_night3_475e9edd:

    # m "Cloudy weather is kind of depressing, don't you think?"
    m "El tiempo nublado es un poco deprimente, ¿no crees?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2562
translate spanish mas_island_night3_85c3e1ba:

    # m "Especially at nighttime, when it hides the stars away from our view."
    m "Especialmente por la noche, cuando nos oculta las estrellas."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2563
translate spanish mas_island_night3_f20ede78:

    # m "It's such a shame, really..."
    m "Es una pena, la verdad..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2566
translate spanish mas_island_night3_bea78cf1:

    # m "What a beautiful night!"
    m "¡Qué noche tan bonita!"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2569
translate spanish mas_island_night3_c9290083:

    # m "There's just something about a cold, crisp night that I love."
    m "No sé qué tienen las noches frías y despejadas, pero me encantan."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2570
translate spanish mas_island_night3_587adf69:

    # m "The contrast of the dark sky and the land covered in snow is really breathtaking, don't you think?"
    m "El contraste entre el cielo oscuro y la tierra cubierta de nieve es realmente impresionante, ¿no crees?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2572
translate spanish mas_island_night3_e4ee3c05:

    # m "If I could, I'd add fireflies."
    m "Si pudiera, añadiría luciérnagas."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2573
translate spanish mas_island_night3_d2a69c03:

    # m "Their lights complement the night sky, it's a pretty sight."
    m "Sus luces complementan el cielo nocturno, es una vista preciosa."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2574
translate spanish mas_island_night3_31906a89:

    # m "Improve the ambience a little, you know?"
    m "Mejoran un poco el ambiente, ¿sabes?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2579
translate spanish mas_island_daynight1_1e694a08:

    # m "Maybe I should add more shrubs and trees."
    m "Quizá debería añadir más arbustos y árboles."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2580
translate spanish mas_island_daynight1_b64c78d4:

    # m "Make the islands prettier you know?"
    m "Hacer las islas más bonitas, ¿sabes?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2581
translate spanish mas_island_daynight1_71e05845:

    # m "I just have to find the right flowers and foliage to go with it."
    m "Solo tengo que encontrar las flores y el follaje adecuados que combinen."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2582
translate spanish mas_island_daynight1_f6e66dda:

    # m "Or maybe each island should have its own set of plants so that everything will be different and have variety."
    m "O quizá cada isla debería tener su propio conjunto de plantas para que todo sea diferente y haya variedad."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2583
translate spanish mas_island_daynight1_20851de6:

    # m "I'm getting excited thinking about it~"
    m "Me emociono solo de pensarlo."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2588
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_c241877f:

    # m "{i}~Windmill, windmill for the land~{/i}"
    m "{i}Molino, molino para la tierra{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2591
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_b8417c9c:

    # m "{i}~Turn forever hand in hand~{/i}"
    m "{i}Gira por siempre mano a mano{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2594
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_a63c2e09:

    # m "{i}~Take it all in on your stride~{/i}"
    m "{i}Tómatelo todo con calma{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2597
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_390f9abc:

    # m "{i}~It is ticking, falling down~{/i}"
    m "{i}El reloj avanza, derrumbándose{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2600
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_0cb3208a:

    # m "{i}~Love forever, love is free~{/i}"
    m "{i}Amor por siempre, el amor es libre{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2603
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_f48cec5c:

    # m "{i}~Let's turn forever, you and me~{/i}"
    m "{i}Giremos por siempre, tú y yo{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2606
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_c241877f_1:

    # m "{i}~Windmill, windmill for the land~{/i}"
    m "{i}Molino, molino para la tierra{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2608
translate spanish mas_island_daynight2_9d627280:

    # m "Ehehe, don't mind me, I just wanted to sing out of the blue~"
    m "Je, je, je, no me hagas caso, solo quería cantar de la nada."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2612
translate spanish mas_island_shimeji_ff344ac6:

    # m "Ah!"
    m "¡Ah!"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2613
translate spanish mas_island_shimeji_d7d68d70:

    # m "How'd she get there?"
    m "¿Cómo ha llegado ahí?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2614
translate spanish mas_island_shimeji_8fbdc8c9:

    # m "Give me a second, [player].{w=0.2}.{w=0.2}.{w=0.2}{nw}"
    m "Dame un segundo, [player]. {w=0.2}.{w=0.2}.{w=0.2}{nw}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2616
translate spanish mas_island_shimeji_25d32cd3:

    # m "All done!"
    m "¡Listo!"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2617
translate spanish mas_island_shimeji_c0c1ae0a:

    # m "Don't worry, I just moved her to a different place."
    m "No te preocupes, solo la he movido a otro sitio."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2636
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_0823f6f7:

    # m "That bookshelf might not look terribly sturdy, but I'm sure it can weather a little snow."
    m "Puede que esa estantería no parezca muy resistente que digamos, pero seguro que aguanta un poco de nieve."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2637
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_f3f9578a:

    # m "It's the books that worry me a bit."
    m "Son los libros lo que me preocupa un poco."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2638
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_63b8c014:

    # m "I just hope they don't get too damaged..."
    m "Solo espero que no se estropeen demasiado..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2641
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_70e79dd1:

    # m "At times like this, I wish I would've kept my books indoors..."
    m "En momentos así, desearía haber guardado mis libros dentro..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2642
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_0b050d56:

    # m "Looks like we'll just have to wait for better weather to read them."
    m "Parece que tendremos que esperar a que haga mejor tiempo para leerlos."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2643
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_5a65ed86:

    # m "In the meantime..."
    m "Mientras tanto..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2644
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_c0e20b26:

    # m "How about cuddling a bit, [player]?"
    m "¿Qué tal si nos acurrucamos un poco, [player]?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2645
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_45d9cd96:

    # m "Ehehe~"
    m "Je, je, je."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2648
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_638d3e7d:

    # m "Some of my favorite books are in there."
    m "Algunos de mis libros favoritos están ahí."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2649
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_a5acafe7:

    # m "{i}Fahrenheit 451{/i}, {i}Hard-Boiled Wonderland{/i}, {i}Nineteen Eighty-Four{/i}, and a few others."
    m "{i}Fahrenheit 451{/i}, {i}El fin del mundo y un despiadado país de las maravillas{/i}, {i}1984{/i} y algunos otros."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2650
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf1_6e3fcff1:

    # m "Maybe we can read them together sometime~"
    m "Quizá podamos leerlos junt[end_letter_gender]s alguna vez."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2658
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_445d5105:

    # m "You know, I wouldn't mind doing some reading outside even if there is a bit of snow."
    m "Sabes, no me importaría leer un poco fuera, aunque haya algo de nieve."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2659
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_9e0315b2:

    # m "Though I wouldn't venture out without a warm coat, a thick scarf, and a snug pair of gloves."
    m "Aunque no me atrevería a salir sin un abrigo caliente, una bufanda gruesa y un par de guantes cómodos."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2660
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_64f30ad1:

    # m "I guess turning the pages might be a bit hard that way, ahaha..."
    m "Supongo que pasar las páginas sería un poco difícil así... ¡Ja, ja, ja!"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2661
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_9d8d0bf4:

    # m "But I'm sure we'll manage somehow."
    m "Pero estoy segura de que nos las arreglaremos de alguna manera."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2662
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_26116031:

    # m "Isn't that right, [player]?"
    m "¿Verdad que sí, [player]?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2665
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_5e66c502:

    # m "Reading indoors with rain just outside the window is pretty relaxing."
    m "Leer dentro con la lluvia justo al otro lado de la ventana es bastante relajante."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2666
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_5325f703:

    # m "If only I hadn't left the books outside..."
    m "Si no me hubiera dejado los libros fuera..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2667
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_10ccb00b:

    # m "I should probably bring some in here when I get the chance."
    m "Probablemente debería traer algunos aquí cuando tenga la oportunidad."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2668
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_35af9f61:

    # m "I'm certain we can find other things to do meanwhile, right [player]?"
    m "Estoy segura de que podemos encontrar otras cosas que hacer mientras tanto, ¿verdad, [player]?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2671
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_eddd17e2:

    # m "Reading outdoors is a nice change of pace, you know?"
    m "Leer al aire libre es un buen cambio de aires, ¿sabes?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2672
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_bbf2806b:

    # m "I'd take a cool breeze over a stuffy library any day."
    m "Prefiero mil veces una brisa fresca a una biblioteca sofocante."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2673
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_24df9cce:

    # m "Maybe I should add a table underneath the Cherry Blossom tree."
    m "Quizá debería añadir una mesa bajo el cerezo."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2674
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_49056641:

    # m "It'd be nice to enjoy a cup of coffee with some snacks to go alongside my book reading."
    m "Estaría bien disfrutar de una taza de café con algo de picar para acompañar mi lectura."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2675
translate spanish mas_island_bookshelf2_88a83baa:

    # m "That'd be wonderful~"
    m "Sería maravilloso."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2686
translate spanish mas_island_spooky_ambience_6d2fedc9:

    # m "{i}It was a dark and stormy night...{/i}"
    m "{i}Era una noche oscura y tormentosa...{/i}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2687
translate spanish mas_island_spooky_ambience_799988fb:

    # m "Ehehe~ This is the perfect time of year for spooky stories, isn't it?"
    m "Je, je, je. Es la época del año perfecta para historias de miedo, ¿no crees?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2688
translate spanish mas_island_spooky_ambience_ca0e74d5:

    # m "If you're in the mood, we should read some together."
    m "Si te apetece, deberíamos leer algunas junt[end_letter_gender]s."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2689
translate spanish mas_island_spooky_ambience_ddbd6d02:

    # m "Although, I don't mind just enjoying the ambience with you for now."
    m "Aunque no me importa disfrutar del ambiente contigo por ahora."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2694
translate spanish mas_island_bloodfall_09ad6983:

    # m "I'm pretty proud of that waterfall there. It was already looking pretty surreal being upside-down."
    m "Estoy bastante orgullosa de esa cascada. Ya se veía bastante surrealista estando al revés."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2695
translate spanish mas_island_bloodfall_919a0b57:

    # m "All I really had to do was change the value of the water to #641F21, and--{nw}"
    m "Lo único que tuve que hacer fue cambiar el valor del agua a #641F21 y... {nw}"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2697
translate spanish mas_island_bloodfall_262bc979:

    # m "Wait, I don't want to ruin the magic for you!{w=0.2} Forget I said that, please!"
    m "Espera, ¡no quiero arruinarte la magia! {w=0.2} ¡Olvida que he dicho eso, por favor!"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2702
translate spanish mas_island_pumpkins_070366f4:

    # m "There's nothing that reminds me of Halloween quite as much as pumpkins."
    m "No hay nada que me recuerde tanto a Halloween como las calabazas."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2703
translate spanish mas_island_pumpkins_49f8236d:

    # m "I thought it would be so cozy to have a bunch of them around my reading nook."
    m "Pensé que quedaría muy acogedor poner unas cuantas alrededor de mi rincón de lectura."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2704
translate spanish mas_island_pumpkins_a2d5d287:

    # m "It's a bit chilly in the rain, but don't you think it would be nice to put on some sweaters and snuggle up together?"
    m "Hace un poco de frío bajo la lluvia, pero ¿no crees que sería agradable ponernos unos jerséis y acurrucarnos junt[end_letter_gender]s?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2705
translate spanish mas_island_pumpkins_d7b59758:

    # m "Maybe I could make some flavored coffee to enhance the mood even more."
    m "Quizá podría hacer café de sabores para mejorar aún más el ambiente."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2711
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_e9a00f13:

    # m "What?"
    m "¿Qué?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2712
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_3d7913b8:

    # m "...{w=0.2}What tombstones? {w=0.2}I'm not sure what you're talking about."
    m "{w=0.2}¿Qué lápidas? {w=0.2}No estoy segura de entender lo que estás diciendo."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2713
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_e901e997:

    # m "Are you...{w=0.2}pfft--"
    m "¿Estás...? {w=0.2}Pfff..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2714
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "¡Ja, ja, ja!"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2715
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_0b1ebf79:

    # m "Sorry, I couldn't resist."
    m "Lo siento, no he podido aguantarme."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2716
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_530d6d0f:

    # m "It would be pretty spooky if those three were still haunting our happy ending, wouldn't it?"
    m "Daría muy mal rollo que esas tres siguieran acechando nuestro final feliz, ¿a que sí?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2719
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_88c761ea:

    # m "Ehehe...I'm not sure if those decorations are entirely tasteful."
    m "Je, je, je... No estoy segura de si esas decoraciones son del todo de buen gusto."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2720
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_add660a9:

    # m "I was thinking, though...{w=0.2}Halloween is a time when some cultures honor the dead."
    m "Aunque estaba pensando... {w=0.2}Halloween es una época en la que algunas culturas honran a los muertos."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2721
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_6a7aaef3:

    # m "Sure, there are a lot of spooky stories about the dead rising, or ghosts haunting people..."
    m "Claro, hay muchas historias de miedo sobre muertos que se levantan o fantasmas que acechan a la gente..."

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2722
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_582b43f8:

    # m "But there's a side of this holiday about remembering, isn't there?"
    m "Pero hay un lado de esta festividad que trata de recordar, ¿no?"

# game/script-islands-event.rpy:2723
translate spanish mas_island_gravestones_3f5e4089:

    # m "I guess I just thought I shouldn't leave them out."
    m "Así que pensé que no estaría de más ponerlas."

translate spanish strings:

    # game/script-islands-event.rpy:1994
    old "Can you show me the floating islands?"
    new "¿Puedes enseñarme las islas flotantes?"

    # game/script-islands-event.rpy:2037
    old "I'm not interested."
    new "No me interesa."

    # game/script-islands-event.rpy:2037
    old "Maybe later."
    new "Quizá luego."

